  "description": "Just when you thought only meat-eaters had all the fun, how about these Coriander and Chilli Patties ‘eh? We promise you they’re not filled with soy or scary fillers; they’re literally just chickpeas, herbs, chilli and flour and they’re delicious. Served on a bed of rice noodles and greens with a tangy dressing, they’re just like meatballs and spaghetti, only Oriental-style, so hold the Parmesan cheese!",
